1
00:00:00,729 --> 00:00:04,319
We smuggle Slurpees, which are
essentially Icees, in under our coats...

2
00:00:04,483 --> 00:00:08,903
(Raj:)...after having a pleasant meal
either here, here or here.

3
00:00:09,404 --> 00:00:10,444
(Howard:)Wow.

4
00:00:10,614 --> 00:00:12,614
(Howard:)- I don't see how we missed that.
SHELDON: Excuse me?

5
00:00:12,783 --> 00:00:16,373
In what universe are Slurpees Icees?

6
00:00:17,704 --> 00:00:19,664
(Raj:)That's how we missed it.

7
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,670
(Leonard:)Would you be prepared,
on a non-precedential basis...

8
00:00:22,834 --> 00:00:25,714
(Leonard:)...to create an emergency
ad hoc Slurpee-Icee equivalency?

9
00:00:25,879 --> 00:00:29,219
(Sheldon:)Oh, Leonard, you know I can't do that.

10
00:00:30,509 --> 00:00:32,589
(Howard:)Okay, I guess we only have one option.

11
00:00:32,761 --> 00:00:34,391
Yup, I don't see any way around it.

12
00:00:35,514 --> 00:00:36,594
- Bye, Sheldon.
- See you.

13
00:00:36,765 --> 00:00:38,185
(Raj:)Later, dude.

14
00:00:44,314 --> 00:00:48,024
(Sheldon:)They're right. It was the only option.

